@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
actor 宠物主人 as Owner
actor 工作人员 as Staff
actor 管理员 as Admin
rectangle "宠物寄养预约与照护管理系统" {
  usecase "UC01 登录与退出" as UC01
  usecase "UC02 维护宠物档案" as UC02
  usecase "UC03 查询可用房间" as UC03
  usecase "UC04 提交寄养预约" as UC04
  usecase "UC05 审核预约并分房" as UC05
  usecase "UC06 取消预约" as UC06
  usecase "UC07 办理入住" as UC07
  usecase "UC08 制定与执行照护计划" as UC08
  usecase "UC09 查看寄养进度" as UC09
  usecase "UC10 办理离店结算" as UC10
  usecase "UC11 维护房间与价格" as UC11
  usecase "UC12 管理工作人员与审计" as UC12
}
Owner -- UC01
Owner -- UC02
Owner -- UC03
Owner -- UC04
Owner -- UC06
Owner -- UC09
Owner -- UC10 : 核对账单
Staff -- UC01
Staff -- UC05
Staff -- UC06
Staff -- UC07
Staff -- UC08
Staff -- UC10
Admin -- UC01
Admin -- UC11
Admin -- UC12
note bottom of UC04
登录为前置条件，非所有用例均包含登录。
系统内部定时任务不是外部参与者。
end note
@enduml
